## 더 나은 풀이
```java
import java.util.*;

public class Main {
    public static void main(String[] args) {
        // Please write your code here.
        Scanner sc = new Scanner(System.in);
        int n = sc.nextInt();

        for (int i = 0; i < n; i++) {
            for (int j = 0; j < n; j++) {
                if (j % 2 == 0) {
                    System.out.print(i+1);
                } else {
                    System.out.print(n-i);
                }
            }
            System.out.println();
        }
    }
}
```

